[h2]Disable Stamina[/h2]
Disables stamina and fatigue for infantry, including AI. It also handles respawns and units handed over between machines in multiplayer. The weapon sway coefficients are 0.3 while stamina is disabled and 1.0 when it is restored. You can change both values.

[h2]How to enable it[/h2]
In Eden, place the [b]Disable Stamina[/b] module to use it in that scenario. A trigger can turn the module on and off. Enable it without an Eden module through [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=450814997]CBA_A3[/url]. Open [b]Addon Options → Disable Stamina[/b], check [b]Enable Disable Stamina[/b] and restart the mission. In multiplayer, use the Server tab.

